page('reviews.html','Book reviews',head('Beyond the poem','The reading continues.','A space for considered conversations with books.')+'<article class="review-feature"><div class="book-placeholder" aria-label="Book cover placeholder"><small>COVER STUDY</small><span>Between<br>the lines.</span><small>REVIEW TEMPLATE</small></div><div><span class="eyebrow">Design sample · Book review</span><h2>A book, read closely.</h2><p>Room for the reviewer’s argument, the book’s details, and the passages that deserve a second look.</p><p class="small muted" style="margin:20px 0">Book and reviewer metadata to be supplied.</p>'+btn('Explore the review layout','review.html',False)+'</div></article><p class="reader-note">Layout sample only. No review or book has been invented or attributed to a real contributor.</p>','Reviews','Book-focused listing with reviewer identity kept separate from book author.')
